    "description": "A hungry alien from another galaxy has finally discovered Earth, \r\na planet teeming with a variety of delicious foods! \r\n\u25b6 Dive into the most unique roguelike RPG with quirky characters!\r\n\u25b6 Experience rapid growth and easy controls in just 8 minutes of gameplay!\r\n\u25b6 Combine your own skills and become stronger with Evolution!\r\n\u25b6 Battle against diverse bosses and monsters across various civilizations!\r\n\u25b6 Enjoy a multitude of game modes for endless entertainment!\r\n\r\nStart your journey to conquer Earth now and immerse yourself in fast-paced, fun-filled Adventures!",
